# Build context for the web version's Dockerfile: everything is excluded, then only what the build needs is let back
# in (the repo also holds the Windows app, its installer and the VS Code extension).
*

!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!global.json
!MdReader.slnx
!src
!web
!webapp

# Never send build outputs, IDE state or tooling folders from inside the allowed paths.
**/bin
**/obj
**/artifacts
**/output
**/node_modules
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.git
**/*.user
**/*.swp
